{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15554","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 裴达","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胜游经小苑，闲望上春城。\n御路韶光发，宫池柳色轻。\n乍浓含雨润，微澹带云晴。\n羃历残烟敛，摇扬落照明。\n几条垂广殿，数树影高旌。\n独有风尘客，思同雨露荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}